OL,3,CSpygate: Ipswich Town training footage
OL,4,Csent to Southampton staff
OL,6,FIt has emerged that Southampton were
OL,7,Fable to predict Ipswich Town's
OL,8,Fstarting line-up for last season's
OL,9,Fcrunch Championship clash between the
OL,10,Ftwo sides after they were sent video
OL,11,Ffootage from a training session.
OL,13,FThe revelation was detailed in the
OL,14,Fwritten reasons given by the League
OL,15,FArbitration Panel which was appointed
OL,16,Fto hear Southampton's appeal against
OL,17,Fbeing thrown out of the Championship
OL,18,Fplay-offs for spying on opponents -
OL,19,Fincluding Ipswich.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/8
