OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F310A1780592614
OL,3,CSpygate: Ipswich Town training footage
OL,4,Csent to Southampton staff
OL,6,FIpswich were training at non-league
OL,7,Fside Eastleigh on the day of the game
OL,8,Fon April 28 which was seen as a
OL,9,Fshootout for second place, with both
OL,10,Fteams fighting for automatic promotion
OL,11,Fto the Premier League.
OL,13,FIt was revealed that someone present
OL,14,Fat Eastleigh that day recorded the
OL,15,Fentire training session - enabling
OL,16,FSouthampton to "predict the exact
OL,17,FIpswich team for the fixture."
OL,26,@yD@^O]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
