OL,3,CSpygate: Ipswich Town training footage
OL,4,Csent to Southampton staff
OL,6,FIn his evidence presented to the
OL,7,Fpanel, Saints boss Tonda Eckert
OL,8,Fclaimed that someone from Eastleigh
OL,9,Fhad provided the footage and he hadn't
OL,10,Fknown about it until a couple of hours
OL,11,Fbefore kick-off.
OL,13,FHowever, an intern said he was asked
OL,14,Fto travel to Eastleigh to spy on the
OL,15,Fsession after being told "the boss is
OL,16,Fadamant that someone needs to go".
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
