PN,31004
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F310A1780592614
OL,3,CSpygate: Ipswich Town training footage
OL,4,Csent to Southampton staff
OL,6,FWhen he refused, another analyst went
OL,7,Finstead on the proviso that he was
OL,8,Fprovided with an Eastleigh kit and 'a
OL,9,Flegend' - an excuse for why he was
OL,10,Fthere in the event he was challenged
OL,11,Fby Ipswich staff.
OL,13,FIt's not clear who filmed the footage,
OL,14,Fbut the commission heard that
OL,15,FEastleigh and Southampton shared "a
OL,16,Fclose working relationship."
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
