OL,3,CSpygate: Ipswich Town training footage
OL,4,Csent to Southampton staff
OL,6,FNewly-released WhatsApp messages
OL,7,Frevealed in the report detailed
OL,8,Fexactly how Southampton orchestrated
OL,9,Ftheir spying missions which also saw
OL,10,FOxford United and Middlesbrough
OL,11,Ftargeted.
OL,13,FThe document stated that junior staff
OL,14,Ffelt "pressurised to do the
OL,15,Fobservations that Mr Eckert and the
OL,16,Fsenior coaches wished them to do".
OL,18,FOn one occasion, an intern was sent to
OL,19,Fspy on Oxford in order to find out
OL,20,Fwhat formation their caretaker manager
OL,21,FCraig Short was likely to play.
OL,26,@vD@FOUxD@aO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/8
