OL,3,CSpygate: Ipswich Town training footage
OL,4,Csent to Southampton staff
OL,6,FWhen he reported back his findings, he
OL,7,Freceived a message saying: "You
OL,8,Flegend. Manager loved it."
OL,10,FSouthampton had pleaded guilty to
OL,11,Fcharges of spying on all three of
OL,12,Ftheir Championship rivals, but argued
OL,13,Fthe punishment of being kicked out of
OL,14,Fthe play-offs, as well as being
OL,15,Fdeducted four points for next season,
OL,16,Fdidn't fit the crime.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G6/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
