OL,3,CSpygate: Ipswich Town training footage
OL,4,Csent to Southampton staff
OL,6,FHowever, the League Arbitration Panel
OL,7,Ffound that it was "clear beyond any
OL,8,Fdoubt that Southampton intended to
OL,9,Fobtain a sporting advantage over their
OL,10,Fleague rivals by cheating".
OL,12,FIn a statement released on Monday,
OL,13,FSouthampton said that they "accepted
OL,14,Fthat the club breached the relevant
OL,15,Fregulations" and would be "reviewing
OL,16,Fits internal processes as a result".
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G7/8
